  "title": "Ukraine and Russia: Peace Talks Initiated by Melania Trump Amid Localized Ceasefire",
  "summary": "Melina Trump hosted Russian and Ukrainian officials at the White House to discuss the localized ceasefire in Oleshky, urging a broader peace effort as she highlights the importance of holding talks to end the conflict.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Melina Trump initiated a ceasefire in the Russian-occupied city of Oleshky to facilitate humanitarian aid and evacuations.",
      "confidence": 0.95
