    {
      "statement": "Ukraine's President Volodymyr Zelensky is set to meet with U.S. special envoys on Tuesday after Trump aimed fresh criticism.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Both sides agreed to pause aerial attacks on each other's capitals during the talks, while Washington aims to end the conflict ahead of the envoys' first visit to Kyiv.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
